  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview rulings (ADR-0035, merged in PR #4181) settle the identity contracts this META tracks: synthetic occurrences follow a per-kind two-axis rule (target kinds = logical identity/dedup; location kinds = site identity keyed by path, target, and within-file occurrence index — line numbers leave identity hashes), and stable_id becomes a unique-within-run key with the full scope chain in the hash plus an explicit emit-time/corpus validator. Re-validate the family after the implementing fixes land."  # 769e
